    nex:description "An increased representation of scientists with lived experiences in the Global South enhances the critical discussions about the necessary steps for solutions to climate change. A reduced presence of students with knowledge of the impacts of decarbonization in local communities limits the formation of next-generation scientists and perpetuates inequities." ;
