    nex:articleId 130507 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description """The effectiveness of conservation agreements is now mostly assessed using impact evaluation methods.
We use a DID with Heterogenous and continuous treatment method for assessing the effect of protected areas on biodiversity.
We estimate the impact of increasing terrestrial protected areas on tree cover loss and the Red List Index""" ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
