<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/106177> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 106177 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description "The articles in this Special dossier address some of the conceptual innovations and controversies raised by Jesús Martin-Barbero's combative and generous spirit. As an introduction to the dossier, we situate and expand on Martin-Barbero's body of work as an academic and public intellectual. We map out some of his personal, political, intellectual, and cultural trajectories as they lead us to a core category in his thinking: mediations. We present the essays in this dossier to show how Martin-Barbero's work is valuable and fundamental to understanding the contemporary moment in Latin America and the Caribbean." ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/7134> ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2023 ;
    nex:title "Word and action: the many routes through Jesús Martín-Barbero" .

