    nex:title "A DTC result for general Banach algebras, and applications. Joint work with Matthias Neufang, Jan Pachl and Juris Steprāns. [Submitted to the Journal of Functional Analyisis ID:  JFA-23-143.]" .

<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/108171> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 108171 ;
    nex:classification "C" ;
    nex:description "© 2022 Universidad Nacional Autonoma de Mexico. All rights reserved.We present measurements of line core positions in UVES spectra of a sample of K-type stars, using the technique of bisector tracing. In all but two of these stars we detect an excess redshift of Ti I lines with respect to Fe I lines. We explain this invoking the temperature-dependence of the line depths. We conclude that the granulation curve is not unique but depends on the chemical species." ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/9546> ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2022 ;
    nex:title "THE DIFFERENTIAL REDSHIFT OF TITANIUM LINES IN K STARS" ;
    nex:url "http://doi.org/10.22201/ia.01851101p.2022.58.02.01"^^xsd:anyURI .

