    nex:articleId 125463 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description """UPT workers are at high risk for mental health porblems.
Workload, time pressures, shift work, and unbalanced job designs are the main predictors of mental health problems among UPT workers.
Interventions focused on the removal of occupational hazards seem to be the most effective option to improve mental health in the UPT industry.""" ;
