    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description """If a reduced bivariate polynomial is quasihomogeneous, then its discriminant is a monomial. Over fields of characteristic 
0, we show that if one adds another simple condition, this becomes an equivalence. We also give a third equivalent condition that is stated geometrically.""" ;
