<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/56152> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 56152 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description """Highlights:
-An integrated methodology of mapping, stratigraphy and geochronology can be applied at low-latitude, complex stratovolcanoes
-Four major-rank unconformities allowed the identification of five Eruptive Epochs.
-Well-developed, widespread paleosols are useful to correlate unconformities.
-The morphostructural unconformities between depositional terraces acquire the characteristics of disconformities.
-Lava-dome and collapse producing block-and-ash flows, vulcanian explosions leading to PDCs, and lahars are the main hazards.""" ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/29928> ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2019 ;
    nex:title "Facing geological mapping t low-latitude volcanoes: The Doña Juana volcanic Complex study-case, SW-Colombia" ;
    nex:url "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jvolgeores.2018.04.016"^^xsd:anyURI .

