<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/70461> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 70461 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description """This work explores the relationship between the magnetic properties of salts based on the
[Ni(dmit) ]− radicals and the different arrangement that these radicals can adopt in the crystals, 2
induced by the packing constrains imposed by the counterions. We base our analysis on Difference
Dedicated Configuration Interaction calculations on models containing two neighbour [Ni(dmit) ]– 2
units with different interaction patterns. The amplitude and sign of these through-space interactions can be rationalized on the basis of a valence-only model, that essentially analyze the effective interactions between the atoms carrying the electronic density of the singly occupied orbitals (SOMO). Despite the simplicity of the model, it provides simple rules to predict the nature and the expected amplitude (strong/medium/weak) of the the leading interactions in systems
based on these [Ni(dmit) ]– radicals. 2""" ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/61850> ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2021 ;
    nex:title "Magnetostructural relationships in [Ni(dmit)2]− radical anions" ;
    nex:url "https://doi.org/10.1039/D1DT00734C"^^xsd:anyURI .

