<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/73321> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 73321 ;
    nex:classification "A" ;
    nex:description "© 2019, Springer Nature America, Inc.Light-sheet fluorescence microscopes are making it possible to follow subcellular dynamics with unprecedented detail, but they are complex to build and maintain. A new method that can generate arbitrary light sheets provides much-needed simplicity and additional versatility." ;
