≲
2
 
 
TeV
, assuming an integrated luminosity of 
3000
 
 
fb
−
1
. In particular, this extends the LHC sensitivity to a previously unstudied region of the ALP parameter space.""" ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/8236> ;
