    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2011 ;
    nex:title "Comparison Between Differently Priced Devices for Digital Capture of X-Ray Films Using Computed Tomography as a Gold Standard: A Multireader-Multicase Receiver Operating Characteristic Curve Study" ;
