<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/87458> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 87458 ;
    nex:description "Writing from Colombia, a country that finds itself at a hopeless juncture, the author invites us to think about how historical imagination can help us to move out of the time-trauma of the narratives of permanent violence and to contribute to shaping a society that can think of a future outside of war." ;
