<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/135090> a nex:JournalArticle ;
    nex:articleId 135090 ;
    nex:description """This article seeks to answer the following research question: How to promote a sense of community among preservice
teachers through an experience of Global Citizenship Education (GCED) developed at a Latin American
university? The study was based on participatory action research in which pre-service teachers at a private
university in Colombia formed working groups, identified global/local problems, proposed collective actions to
confront them, exchanged ideas with students from other Latin American universities, and reflected on their
learning process throughout this experience. The results show that the collaborative learning experience promoted
in this study generated learning in three areas in which a sense of community is manifested: belonging, solidarity,
and social responsibility. Discussions and conclusions highlight the need to promote alternative narratives and
GCED experiences from a decolonial perspective.""" ;
    nex:hasAuthor <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/7034>,
        <https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/professor/8174> ;
    nex:productType "article" ;
    nex:publicationYear 2025 ;
    nex:title "Sense of Community and Global Citizenship Education: A Participatory Action Research in Colombia. Journal of the Social and Citizenship Education Association of Australia." ;
    nex:url "https://mcusercontent.com/d85d9c27ebff921d1e09c651a/files/b813b136-e22c-f171-ef0b-b424eeafa20d/TSE_Volume_42_Number"^^xsd:anyURI .

