    nex:articleId 135287 ;
    nex:description "Sarmiento, A., Goméz, C. E., Julio-Rodríguez, T., & Sánchez, J. A. (2025). Linking colony morphology and metabolic performance in sympatric zooxanthellate octocorals (Cnidaria: Octocorallia): a functional trait approach. Marine Biology, 173(1). https://doi.org/10.1007/s00227-025-04762-w" ;
