    nex:title "CH‧‧‧ X (X= F, Cl) and Cl‧‧‧ Cl halogen-mediated interactions driving the crystal packing in N-substituted 4-arylimidazoles" ;
    nex:url "http://doi.org/10.1016/j.molstruc.2022.134181"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/nexus/resource/article/105360> a nex:JournalArticle ;
