W
 boson absolute rapidity. The measurement uses events in which a 
W
 boson decays to a neutrino and either a muon or an electron. The data sample of proton-proton collisions recorded with the CMS detector at the LHC in 2016 corresponds to an integrated luminosity of 
35.9
 
 
fb
−
